        "eyebrow": "Your Fit, Your Way",
        "heading": "Finding the right fit should feel effortless.",
        "intro_text": "Penya pieces are designed with care for how clothes feel on a real body. Take two minutes with these four measurements and we will do the rest.",
        "table_heading": "Size Reference",
        "table_note": "All measurements in centimetres. Ranges are intentionally broad to cover slim, regular, and fuller builds. If your measurements fall between two sizes, size up for comfort. Women's column shows bust. Kids' sizes are by age range — use measurements as the guide, not age alone. For a bespoke fit, contact us.",
        "note_heading": "A note on fit",
        "note_text": "Penya pieces are designed with intentional ease — we do not cut for a single body type. Some styles have a relaxed silhouette by design; others are more tailored. Each product page includes specific fit notes where relevant. If you are unsure, or if your child's proportions don't match our ranges, our team is always happy to advise — including for bespoke commissions."
